║                                                                          ║
║  SMOOTHNESS UPGRADES:                                                   ║
║  ✅ GPU-composited layer management (transform3d, will-change)           ║
║  ✅ Spring-physics easing on all interactive elements                    ║
║  ✅ CSS @starting-style for zero-jank entry animations                  ║
║  ✅ Interpolating size transitions (no layout thrash)                    ║
